# ── Vallaris (GISTDA) flood-extent service — SERVER ONLY ──
# Used exclusively by the /api/flood route handler (never sent to the browser).
# Get a key from the Vallaris console and paste it here in your local .env.local.
# NOTE: any key that has ever appeared in shared JSON / source control must be
# rotated before production use.
VALLARIS_API_KEY=

# Optional overrides (defaults are baked into src/configs/endpoint.ts)
# VALLARIS_BASE_URL=https://vallaris.dragonfly.gistda.or.th/core/api/features/1.1
# VALLARIS_FLOOD_COLLECTION=68ed51a9b630c46bc8bf4c1d
